        "LocalizationKey": "Forest_Lore_CavePaintings_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "The walls of this chamber are covered in paint gone the colour of dried blood and old rust. Hunters with long spears ring a herd of deer, a bear rears over a man with his arms flung up, and a line of fish swims along the foot of the wall. Handprints crowd the edges, small ones among them. Nobody has added to it in a very long time."
